<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 373 0 R
/E (The original plan was to use Make.com for the automation workflow. However, during implementation, it became clear that Instagram's comment-trigger functionality was not available for this account through Make.com due to limitations in Instagram's API access for third-party automation platforms.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
765 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 373 0 R
/E (To overcome this, Manychat was used instead. As an official Meta partner, Manychat is specifically designed to support Instagram comment-to-DM automation, making it the most suitable tool for this use case.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
