/P 376 0 R
/E (As a one-person operation, planning content across three pillars and four funnel phases can get disorganized without a system. This automation turns a simple running list of ideas into a structured content backlog automatically, reducing the planning overhead that would otherwise fall entirely on the founder. It also demonstrates Make.com's strength for structured, low-frequency workflows)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [1]
>>
